  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conf women entrep SPB2003</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konf kvinnl f&#xF6;ret SPB2003</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">N&#xE4;r St. Petersburg firar sitt 300-&#xE5;rsjubileum 2003, kommer Sida att fokusera p&#xE5; samarbetet mellan International Institute Woman &amp; Manage- ment i SPB och Spr&#xE5;ngbr&#xE4;dan, som genomf&#xF6;rts i Sida-finansierade projekt. Genom deltagande i &quot;Women Who Changed the World&quot;-konferensen med seminarier om kvinnligt f&#xF6;retagande, syftar projektet p&#xE5; n&#xE4;tverksbyggande mellan sm&#xE5;f&#xF6;retag i Sverige och Ryssland.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">When St. Petersburg celebrates its 300th anniversary, Sida will focus on the co-operation between International Institute Woman &amp; Manage- ment in SPB and Spr&#xE5;ngbr&#xE4;dan, performed in Sida-financed projects. Through participation in the &quot;Women Who Changed the World&quot; Conference with seminars on women entrepeneurship, the projects aims at network- ing between SMEs in Sweden and Russia.</narrative>
  </description>
